        <item>
            <title>0.2.0  (2026-11-12)</title>
            <description>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Added support for &lt;code&gt;FASL&lt;/code&gt;_&lt;code&gt;DIR&lt;/code&gt; environment variable. When it is set, Slynk writes fasl-files into that directory (mirroring the structure of sources) instead of placing them near the sources. This makes it possible to connect Sly to a server, running under another user or with a read-only filesystem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
            <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        </item>
